OL,3,ACanada says it will match US tariffs
OL,4,A'dollar for dollar' as trade talks
OL,5,Abreak down
OL,6,
OL,7,FA fresh wave of US tariffs on a wide
OL,8,Farray of Canadian goods has come into
OL,9,Feffect as of midnight on Saturday after
OL,10,Fa last minute break down in trade
OL,11,Ftalks.
OL,13,FAnnouncing the suspension of
OL,14,Fnegotiations shortly before the Friday
OL,15,Fnight deadline, Canadian Prime Minister
OL,16,FMark Carney said he would impose
OL,17,Freciprocal tariffs on US goods "dollar
OL,18,Ffor dollar".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
