OL,3,ACanada says it will match US tariffs
OL,4,A'dollar for dollar' as trade talks
OL,5,Abreak down
OL,6,
OL,7,FCarney said "last-minute changes in the
OL,8,FUS proposed terms were unfair,
OL,9,Funeconomic, and called into question
OL,10,Fthe reliability of any deal".
OL,12,FTrade negotiators had been engaged in
OL,13,Fintense talks since July, after
OL,14,FPresident Donald Trump threatened to
OL,15,Fimpose a 50% levy on nearly $20bn
OL,16,F(C$28bn) of Canadian imports by 19
OL,17,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
